he integration of demand and supply analytics. This study demonstrates how machine learning may transform crop management by assisting farmers in making data-driven decisions to match their output with supply and demand in the market, as well as by optimizing resource allocation and raising total yield. © The Author(s), under exclusive license to Springer Nature Switzerland AG 2026.},
